					"body": "At 00:13–00:17, the creator pulls back his cuffs to show off two luxury watches on his bare wrists. In the original footage, he deliberately pauses his wrists toward the lens for 2 seconds. To achieve this in your own video, use **Segment Anything 2 (SAM 2)** in ComfyUI or **Runway's Act-One / Motion Brush Inpainting** to create a tight moving mask around each wrist. Run a localized inpainting pass prompted for a *rose-gold luxury chronograph watch with an emerald dial*. Because only a small 100x100 pixel region around the wrist is regenerated, the watch stays sharper and more detailed than a full-frame render."
