					"body": "Professional vacation-rental management companies list the exact same beach house or mountain cabin on Airbnb (which adds a 14.2% guest service fee) AND on their own direct booking website. Right-click the main listing photo or search the exact property title on Google—booking directly with the verified property manager saves the entire 14% Airbnb service fee."
